#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:578
msgid ""
"This basic procedure does not allow a user to save the file into folder "
"other than one already provided. An expanded procedure is needed to explain "
"how to save a file into other folders in the file system. The next section "
"explains the extra elements provided when the <interface>File "
"Save</interface> dialog is expanded and that section is followed by a step-"
"by-step procedure explaining how to use this expanded dialog."
msgstr ""
"Med den här grundmetoden kan du bara spara filen i en av mapparna som redan "
"visas. För att spara i en annan mapp behöver du följa den utförligare "
"metoden. Nästa avsnitt beskriver de extra delarna som visas när dialogrutan "
"<interface>Spara fil</interface> fälls ut. Därefter följer stegvisa "
"instruktioner för det utfällda läget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:599
msgid ""
"The extra components in the expanded <interface>File Save</interface> "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"De extra komponenterna i den utfällda dialogrutan <interface>Spara "
"fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:604
msgid ""
"In order to select folders other than those provided in the drop down list "
"shown as area <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> in <xref linkend=\"fig-"
"file-save-dialog-compact-components\"/>, the <interface>File "
"Save</interface> dialog must be expanded by clicking in the area labeled "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">D</emphasis>. In the expanded form, the "
"<interface>File Save</interface> dialog allows a user to select a new folder"
" in which to save a file, to create new folders, and to add bookmark folders"
" to the list provided in the area labeled <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill välja en annan mapp än dem i listan i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> i <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-compact-"
"components\"/> måste du fälla ut dialogrutan <interface>Spara "
"fil</interface> genom att klicka i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">D</emphasis> i dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>. I"
" utfällt läge kan du välja en annan mapp att spara filen i, skapa mappar och"
" lägga till bokmärkesmappar i listan i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:619
msgid ""
"This section will explain the extra components of the <interface>File "
"Save</interface> dialog which are provided when the dialog is expanded. "
"<xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/> shows these "
"different areas and adds a label to each."
msgstr ""
"I det här avsnittet beskrivs de extra komponenter som visas när dialogrutan "
"<interface>Spara fil</interface> fälls ut. I <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-"
"dialog-expanded-components\"/> visas områdena med varsin etikett."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:629
msgid "The expanded form of the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog."
msgstr "Den utfällda dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:640
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the 'File Save' dialog in its expanded form with the"
" different areas labeled."
msgstr ""
"Den här skärmbilden visar dialogrutan ”Spara fil” i utfällt läge, med de "
"olika områdena utmärkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:661
msgid ""
"The extra components in the expanded version of the <interface>File "
"Save</interface> dialog"
msgstr ""
"De extra komponenterna i den utfällda dialogrutan <interface>Spara "
"fil</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:665
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> - The 'relative root' selection area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> – Område för val av ”relativ rot”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:671
msgid ""
"This area allows the user to select the starting folder from which to "
"navigate the folder hierarchy. The navigation system only allows users to "
"select sub-folders of the currently selected 'relative root' folder so the "
"root folder selected in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> must "
"contain the desired folder as a sub-folder."
msgstr ""
"Här väljer du startmappen för navigering i mapphierarkin. Du kan bara välja "
"undermappar till den valda ”relativa roten”. Därför måste mappen som väljs i"
" område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> innehålla den önskade mappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:681
msgid ""
"The folders listed in this area include the standard folders provided by the"
" system and a number of folders added, as bookmark folders, by the user. The"
" standard folders provided by the system will vary for different machines "
"and system administrators may have disabled access to certain areas. By "
"default, the standard folders provided include the user's 'Home' folder, the"
" user's 'Desktop' folder, a folder pointing to the root of the filesystem "
"tree and folders for each of the removable storage devices attached to the "
"computer. The user's home folder, on GNU and other UNIX like systems, this "
"folder is usually known as <literal>~</literal> or "
"<literal>~user_account_name</literal> where the phrase "
"<literal>user_account_name</literal> represents the account name used by the"
" current user. This folder is often located at "
"<filename>/home/user_account_name/</filename> in the filesystem. The "
"'Desktop' folder is the folder which holds the files which are displayed in "
"the background of the user's window. The 'Filesystem' folder is the top of "
"the filesystem tree, which on GNU systems is also known as "
"<filename>/</filename>. The list also presents peripheral or external "
"devices. Below the standard folders, area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> has a separator and the bookmark folders selected"
" by the user. In <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/> the folder <filename>currentWork</filename> is a folder named"
" by the user and added to the list of bookmark folders."
msgstr ""
"Listan innehåller systemets standardmappar och eventuella mappar som "
"användaren har lagt till som bokmärken. Standardmapparna kan variera mellan "
"datorer, och systemadministratören kan ha begränsat åtkomsten till vissa "
"platser. Som standard visas användarens hemmapp ”Hem”, skrivbordsmappen "
"”Skrivbord”, en mapp till filsystemets rot och mappar för anslutna flyttbara"
" lagringsenheter. I GNU och andra Unix-liknande system skrivs hemmappen "
"vanligtvis som <literal>~</literal> eller "
"<literal>~user_account_name</literal>, där "
"<literal>user_account_name</literal> står för den aktuella användarens "
"kontonamn. Mappen finns ofta på "
"<filename>/home/user_account_name/</filename> i filsystemet. "
"Skrivbordsmappen innehåller filerna som visas på skrivbordets bakgrund. "
"Mappen ”Filsystem” är filsystemets översta nivå, även kallad "
"<filename>/</filename> på GNU-system. Listan visar också kringutrustning och"
" externa enheter. Under standardmapparna i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> finns en avdelare och användarens "
"bokmärkesmappar. I <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/> är <filename>currentWork</filename> en användarskapad mapp "
"som lagts till bland bokmärkena."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:718
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> - The folder hierarchy area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> – Mapphierarkin."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:722
msgid ""
"This area displays the folder hierarchy starting from the starting folder "
"selected in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> and ending in the "
"current folder, the folder whose contents are displayed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, while displaying all the folders between the "
"two. This area changes dynamically as the user changes to new folders. In "
"the case shown in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/>, the user has selected the 'Home' folder as the starting "
"folder in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> and has not navigated to"
" any sub-folders."
msgstr ""
"Här visas mapphierarkin från startmappen i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> till den aktuella mappen, vars innehåll visas i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, samt alla mappar däremellan. "
"Visningen ändras när du navigerar till andra mappar. I exemplet i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/> har användaren valt "
"”Home” som startmapp i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> och ännu "
"inte navigerat till någon undermapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:741
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> - The Folder Creation button."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> – Knappen Skapa mapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:745
msgid ""
"This button allows the user to create a folder in the directory listed in "
"the rightmost part of the file component area, area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. When this button is clicked, by placing the "
"mouse pointer over the button and clicking with the primary mouse button, a "
"new folder is added to the list in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>"
" with a temporary name of '<filename>Type name of New Folder</filename>' "
"pre-selected and therefore ready to be edited into a new name."
msgstr ""
"Med knappen skapar du en mapp i katalogen som visas längst till höger i "
"mapphierarkin, område <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. Klicka på "
"knappen med primär musknapp. En ny mapp läggs till i listan i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> med det tillfälliga namnet "
"<filename>Type name of New Folder</filename> markerat, så att du kan skriva "
"ett nytt namn direkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:762
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> - The folder content area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> – Mappinnehållet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:778
msgid ""
"Firstly, hidden folders and files, those that start with a leading period, "
"are not displayed by default. These can be shown by placing the mouse "
"pointer over area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, clicking with one of"
" the secondary mouse buttons to raise the context menu, moving the pointer "
"onto the <guimenuitem>Show hidden files</guimenuitem> menu entry, and "
"clicking with the primary mouse button. This step will ensure that all the "
"folders are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Dolda mappar och filer, vars namn börjar med en punkt, visas inte som "
"standard. Visa dem genom att öppna snabbmenyn i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, välja <guimenuitem>Visa dolda "
"filer</guimenuitem> och klicka med primär musknapp. Då visas alla mappar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:791
msgid ""
"Secondly, the filtering rule defined in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">L</emphasis> will limit the files displayed based on the "
"characteristics of these files. By default, a filtering rule is applied "
"which causes only those files present that have an extension commonly used "
"for spreadsheet files. The rule can be changed to display all the files "
"regardless of their extension, except possibly for the hidden files."
msgstr ""
"Filtreringsregeln i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">L</emphasis> begränsar "
"också vilka filer som visas. Som standard visas bara filer med en filändelse"
" som vanligtvis används för kalkylblad. Du kan ändra regeln så att alla "
"filer visas oavsett filändelse, eventuellt med undantag för dolda filer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:767
msgid ""
"This area displays the contents of the currently selected folder which is "
"the rightmost folder shown in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. "
"<_:warning-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Här visas innehållet i den valda mappen, alltså mappen längst till höger i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. <_:warning-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:809
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">J</emphasis> - The panel rearrangement handles."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">J</emphasis> – Handtag för att ändra panelernas "
"storlek."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:828
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">K</emphasis> - The bookmark folder list modification"
" buttons."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">K</emphasis> – Knappar för att ändra listan med "
"bokmärkesmappar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:834
msgid ""
"These buttons will add or remove folders to or from the list of bookmark "
"folders in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>. The "
"<guibutton>Add</guibutton> button will add the folder currently selected in "
"area <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. The <guibutton>Remove</guibutton>"
" button will remove any bookmark folder that is selected in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Med knapparna lägger du till eller tar bort mappar i listan med "
"bokmärkesmappar i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>. "
"<guibutton>Lägg till</guibutton> lägger till mappen som är vald i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. <guibutton>Ta bort</guibutton> tar "
"bort den bokmärkesmapp som är vald i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:849
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">L</emphasis> - The filter definition area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">L</emphasis> – Filterinställningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:854
msgid ""
"This area contains a drop down menu with the different filters defined by "
"the application. <application>Gnumeric</application> currently defines two "
"filters. The first filters out all files that do not have an extension used "
"by the spreadsheet formats supported by gnumeric. The second filter, labeled"
" \"All files\", essentially disables any filtering operation, and lists all "
"the files in the currently selected folder, except that files starting with "
"a leading period are not shown."
msgstr ""
"Här finns en lista med programmets filter. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har för närvarande två filter. Det "
"första döljer filer vars filändelser inte används av kalkylbladsformat som "
"stöds av Gnumeric. Det andra, ”Alla filer”, stänger i praktiken av "
"filtreringen och visar alla filer i den valda mappen, utom filer vars namn "
"börjar med en punkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:650
msgid ""
"The different parts of each panel of the <interface>File Save</interface> "
"dialog after it has been expanded have been shaded with boxes of different "
"colors and labeled with a letter in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-"
"expanded-components\"/>. Five of the labeled areas are the same as the areas"
" in the dialog when it is in a compact form; these areas were explained "
"above. The remaining areas are explained below: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"De olika delarna av varje panel i den utfällda dialogrutan <interface>Spara "
"fil</interface> är skuggade i olika färger och märkta med bokstäver i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/>. Fem av områdena är "
"desamma som i den kompakta dialogrutan och beskrevs ovan. De övriga "
"förklaras här: <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:874
msgid ""
"The uses of the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog in its expanded form"
" is explained below."
msgstr ""
"Nedan beskrivs hur den utfällda dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>"
" används."
